world  ball rolls down a ramp into a cup

floor
  size      5 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

ramp
  is a       ramp
  high end   65 cm up
  low end    1.2 m along, 34 cm up
  width      30 cm
  thickness  2 cm
  friction   0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.001
  bounce     dead
  colour     wood

cup
  is an             open box
  length            70 cm
  width             40 cm
  walls             30 cm
  near wall height  30 cm
  wall thickness    2 cm
  base thickness    2 cm
  on                floor, 35 cm beyond ramp.foot
  friction          0.9, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.02
  bounce            dead
  colour            grey

ball
  is a      sphere 3 cm radius, 150 g
  rolls
  moves     freely
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.001
  colour    orange
  on        ramp, 12 cm from the top

expect
  ball touches ramp
  ball comes to rest in cup
